<SiteLayout title="About" description="Why Easy Garden Plan turns local conditions into practical growing guidance.">
  <article class="page-shell py-20 sm:py-28"><div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl"><p class="text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-primary">About Easy Garden Plan</p><h1 class="display-title mt-5 text-5xl font-semibold sm:text-6xl">Garden advice should fit the garden in front of you.</h1><div class="mt-10 space-y-6 text-lg leading-8 text-muted"><p>Generic planting calendars skip the details that change what works: location, frost, sun, bed shape, and the plants you actually want.</p><p>Easy Garden Plan brings those details together and turns them into an understandable schedule. The free plan provides the plan and monitoring instructions; Pro can watch changing conditions and send timely recommendations.</p><p>The goal is simple: less guessing, fewer missed windows, and a garden plan you can use outside with dirt on your hands.</p></div></div></article>
